    the parser block from the script.

  * ``test_wf408a3_smoke_integration`` — full integration: pre-flight
    reads the post-touch mtime + test syntax OK + 6/6 PASS.

Per AGENTS.md §5.2 honest framing, all assertions are MEASURED via
stat() / subprocess / re.compile against the actual on-disk state.
No PROJECTED claims — every assertion has a verifiable source path.
"""
